<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:07:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>游戏配音总听着“不对劲”——问题不在演员身上</title><link>https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/why-your-game-vo-always-sounds-off-and-its-not-the-actors-3nfn</link><description>配音忽大忽小多半不是录音问题，而是各条音频没统一到同一响度标准，文章给出 LUFS 与真峰值的对齐办法。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:41:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">72b3444ab36c5a58e61c6661787f8b106f0266fd</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nan_nan_d86f644d31091c00f/why-your-game-vo-always-sounds-off-and-its-not-the-actors-3nfn">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unity XR 开发中的 AI 智能体：从写代码到测试 VR 工作流</title><link>https://dev.to/divyesh_makawana/-ai-agents-in-unity-xr-development-from-writing-code-to-testing-vr-workflows-og</link><description>作者以 Meta Quest 3 开发者视角，聊 AI 工具如何从代码提示走向与开发工具联动的工作流，这对调试环节繁杂的 XR 开发尤其有价值。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:10:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a62502b4a0cc46e005de34d69aa8cb193b18945b</guid><source url="https://dev.to/divyesh_makawana/-ai-agents-in-unity-xr-development-from-writing-code-to-testing-vr-workflows-og">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>如何为你的第一款电子游戏做 Playtest</title><link>https://unity.com/blog/how-to-playtest-your-first-video-game</link><description>Unity 官方的新手指南，讲清什么是 Playtest、为什么重要，以及如何组织一次测试并把反馈落到用 AI 辅助开发的流程里。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3486df46b65296899f6e959e160582d7b06a8a4a</guid><source url="https://unity.com/blog/how-to-playtest-your-first-video-game">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link