flow-4g6h</link><description>作者复盘上次 Game Jam 为一枚旋转金币折腾两小时的教训，分享 16×16 金币四帧精灵表的完整制作流程，一晚就能做完并在 Phaser 里清晰播放。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:30:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e043ae69a9a8a6f5c5ffe8b01a7703474c2b2d33</guid><source url="https://dev.to/joanbernier/pixel-art-for-a-game-jam-my-16x16-coin-sprite-sheet-workflow-4g6h">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用这款 Godot 工具轻松打造精美的风格化水面</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/create-beautiful-stylized-water-easily-with-this-godot-tool</link><description>这款 Godot 水面工具集成了 Gerstner 波浪、岸边泡沫、焦散、倒影与瀑布等效果，帮开发者快速做出风格化水体。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0ade7f86601b8062720a6393ad7f3b5af3c56220</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/create-beautiful-stylized-water-easily-with-this-godot-tool">80 Level</source></item><item><title>2026 年 HTML5 游戏开发成本指南：买家参考</title><link>https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/html5-game-development-cost-in-2026-a-buyers-guide-46m2</link><description>简单休闲小游戏约 3000 至 15000 美元，带定制美术与排行榜的品牌活动游戏约 1 万至 4 万美元，这份指南帮你按预算给外包报价定个锚。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">97f7be1cf1966ae74a3e274a6200ef205d13b268</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/html5-game-development-cost-in-2026-a-buyers-guide-46m2">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Godot 迎来新白金赞助商 Manus AI</title><link>https://gamefromscratch.com/godots-new-sponsor-manus-ai</link><description>Manus AI 成为 Godot 基金会的白金级赞助商，AI 公司赞助开源项目已不新鲜，但对社区来说仍是个值得关注的动向。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:23:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d590a3b6f562375be10726f2092453dd0a654c4d</guid><source url="https://gamefromscratch.com/godots-new-sponsor-manus-ai">GameFromScratch</source></item><item><title>GTA 6 尚未发售已领跑 2026 年游戏大奖提名，获 8 项提名：工艺与开发要点</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/gta-6-leads-the-game-awards-2026-nominees-with-8-nods-before-launch-key-craft-gamedev-takeaways-4i2e</link><description>《GTA 6》发售前就以 8 项